    "discovery": "Five alternating fresh-process pairs on 30 source files and 6,000 Python files beneath .venv, node_modules, and .git. Time only initial expand_paths; separately count real scandir calls and run the shipped no-dunder-all rule to prove identical retained file sets and one ordered finding.",
